<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Yet He found me; I beheld Him</l><l>Bleeding on the cursed tree;</l><l>Heard Him pray, Forgive them, Father,</l><l>And my wistful heart said faintly,</l><l>Some of self, and some of Thee,</l><l>Some of self, and some of Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Day by day His tender mercy,</l><l>Healing, helping, full and free,</l><l>Sweet and strong, and ah! so patient,</l><l>Brought me lower while I whispered,</l><l>Less of self, and more of Thee,</l><l>Less of self, and more of Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Higher than the highest heavens,</l><l>Deeper than the deepest sea,</l><l>Lord, Thy love at last hath conquered;</l><l>Grant me now my heart’s petition,</l><l>None of self, and all of Thee,</l><l>None of self, and all of Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
